[00:13.46]1. Help in our lives, Jehovah provides,
[00:13.46]Shepherds to tend his flock.
[00:13.46]By their example they serve as guides,
[00:13.46]Showing us how to walk.
[00:13.46](Chorus)
[00:20.18]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[00:22.00]Men who are loyal and true.
[00:25.60]They show concern for his precious sheep;
[00:25.60]Love them for all that they do.
[00:25.60]2. Shepherds who love us care how we feel;
[01:04.18]Gently they guide the way.
[01:04.86]When we are hurt, they help us to heal,
[01:04.86]Kind in the words they say.
[01:04.86](Chorus)
[01:05.26]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[01:12.40]Men who are loyal and true.
[01:20.76]They show concern for his precious sheep;
[01:28.28]Love them for all that they do.
[02:14.52]3. Godly advice and counsel they give,
[02:18.18]That we may never stray.
[02:18.18]Thus they assist us, God’s way to live,
[02:18.20]Serving him ev’ry day.
[02:18.36](Chorus)
[02:19.38]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[02:25.88]Men who are loyal and true.
